<title>USA: Lehman names Dickey global equity chief.</title>
<headline>Lehman names Dickey global equity chief.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it had named Richard Dickey managing director and head of global equity sales.</p>
<p>In a statement on Thursday, the company said Dickey, 41, joined Lehman from Dillon, Read &amp; Co, where he had been managing director and head of equity research for the past two years.</p>
<p>Dickey replaces Raymond Struble, 45, who will be retiring from Lehman after a 15-year career with the firm.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
